{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/284519/", "pk": 284519, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/", "pk": 929, "shortname": "livingoceanscuba", "name": "Living Ocean Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Turtle Canyons Snorkel Excursion", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Turtle Canyons Snorkel Excursion", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "##Enjoy a trip along the Waikiki Coast to Turtle Canyons snorkeling site. \n\n##Duration\n- 2 Hours (approx.)\n\n\n##About\n\nThis spot is known for the large numbers of sea turtles that float above the reef while the reef fish swim around them and clean their shells. When the turtles come up to breath they can even be seen by spectators relaxing on the boat! After you have gotten your fill of snorkeling climb back onboard and relax in the sun with complimentary snack and beverages. Kick back and watch out for spinner dolphins and humpback whales (whales sighted in winter months December to April) while you cruise back to the harbor. Driving Directions will be included in your confirmation email to the boat at Kewalo Basin, 1125 Ala Moana Blvd, Slip B1,  Honolulu, HI 96814\n\n\n###Tour Highlights\n- Marine life (we spot Hawaiian Green Sea Turtles on most of our trips and there is always a chance for dolphins, flying fish and more!)\n- Snorkeling at Waikiki's Famous turtle hangout \"Turtle Canyons\"\n- Enjoy cruising along the Waikiki Coast\n- Great Opportunity for photographers\n- Perfect for the whole family\n\n##About the Boat\n- 50ft Custom Built Passenger Vessel\n- 40 Passenger Maximum Capacity\n- Shaded and Sunny Areas\n- Toilet On Board\n- Seating for 10 on Upper Deck \n- Seating for 40 on Main Deck (Half Sun / Half Shade)\n- Standing / Floor Seating for 10 on Bow (Full Sun)\n\n###What's Included\n- Cold Drinks (Juices and Sodas)\n- Water\n- Light Snacks\n- Snorkeling Equipment and in-water snorkel  guides\n\n###Additional Information\n\n**Weather Cancellation** - In the event of unsafe weather or heavy rain we will cancel the tour. We will notify guests via email and text message (if a text message capable phone number has been provided) as soon as the cancellation is made. If you have purchased your ticket directly through Living Ocean you will have the option of rescheduling (based on availability) or a full refund. If your ticket was purchased through a 3rd party you will have the option of rescheduling (based on availability). As we do not control the refunds of 3rd parties or daily deal sites please refer to the refund policy of the business you purchased your ticket through in the event of a cancellation.\n\n**Sea Sickness** - Generally the ocean is calm near Waikiki, but if you are prone to sea sickness or are not accustomed to being aboard ocean going boats we suggest you consult your doctor or pharmacist about taking preventative measures prior to your trip.\n\n**Departure Time / Late Arrivals**  - Out of respect to our guests we attempt to leave on time for every trip. If you are running late and do not arrive at the boat prior to the start of the passenger safety briefing your ticket will be forfeited. Refunds cannot be processed for no-shows / late arrivals so please plan ahead and arrive on time.\n\n**Parking** - Parking is available at Kewalo Basin Boat Harbor for $2 per hour (pay via QR code). Please refer to the Kewalo Basin Boat Harbor Map below and in your confirmation email for parking areas and our boat's location.\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/alsYpPIOTR7cbCtNKMLQ)", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Sea Sickness\nWe recommend taking sea sick medication if you are not regularly on the ocean. Please follow the directions on the package / a medical professional. It needs to be taken prior coming to the boat and/or the night before to be affective. Sea sickness medication is available as an over the counter medication at local pharmacies. As it needs to be taken prior to arrival we do not have sea sickness medication available on the boat. \n\n##What to Bring\n- Towels\n- Hat, Sunglasses, Sunscreen\n- Wear Swimming Attire\n- Cameras\n- Crew Gratuity (not required)\n\n**Full Face Masks** - For your safety we do not permit full snorkeling masks on our tours\n\n###Additional Information\n\n**Sea Sickness** - Generally the ocean is calm near Waikiki, but if you are prone to sea sickness or are not accustomed to being aboard ocean going boats we suggest you consult your doctor or pharmacist about taking preventative measures prior to your trip.\n\n**Departure Time / Late Arrivals**  - Out of respect to our guests we attempt to leave on time for every trip. If you are running late and do not arrive at the boat prior to the scheduled departure time your ticket will be forfeited. Refunds cannot be processed for no-shows / late arrivals so please plan ahead and arrive on time.\n\n*Refund Requests*\n\nIf you would like to request a refund due to unforeseen circumstances please visit our partner [TourClaim](https://link.getcopernican.com/livingoceanscuba) and submit a refund request.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Snorkel Turtle Canyon with our experienced guides. All snorkeling equipment is included.", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/284519/images/534998/", "pk": 534998, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/I0sGDrfjQKmfZKhduuxP", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/I0sGDrfjQKmfZKhduuxP", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/284519/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/I0sGDrfjQKmfZKhduuxP", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/I0sGDrfjQKmfZKhduuxP", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/284519/images/1573112/", "pk": 1573112, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kpRWprfrQgWqcrfencSY", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kpRWprfrQgWqcrfencSY", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/284519/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kpRWprfrQgWqcrfencSY", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kpRWprfrQgWqcrfencSY", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/284519/images/1573132/", "pk": 1573132, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/SelNQhqZQBe8MpwPxCLQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Se